# Lucid
# Converted Core ML models. Model/ is ~1.9 GB, but almost none of it ships:
# 880 MB of EfRLFN and 19 MB of Real-ESRGAN were converted only to measure
# against, Model/SPAN is the upstream BasicSR checkout, and Model/weights holds
# training checkpoints. None of those belong in git.
#
# The six packages the app actually loads are a different matter: they are
# 527 kB each, 3.0 MB for the whole ladder, and without them a clone is useless.
# LearnedUpscaler is the only upscaler and has no fallback by design, so a build
# missing these throws Failure.noModel on every session and the app silently
# enhances nothing. Three megabytes is a cheap price for `git clone` producing a
# working app, so the shipping ladder is tracked and the rest stays ignored.
#
# Keep this list in step with LearnedUpscaler.variants and Tools/release.sh.
Model/*
!Model/SPAN_x4_ch32u_256x144.mlpackage
!Model/SPAN_x4_ch32u_320x180.mlpackage
!Model/SPAN_x4_ch32u_432x240.mlpackage
!Model/SPAN_x4_ch32u_480x270.mlpackage
!Model/SPAN_x4_ch32u_640x360.mlpackage
!Model/SPAN_x4_ch32u_864x480.mlpackage
# Test clips are large and re-encodable from public sources; see TestSite/README.
TestSite/*.mp4
TestSite/*.webm
TestSite/*.mov
# Bench and capture output.
output/
.build/
*.profraw
.venv-convert/
output/gallery/
.build/degradation/
